    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This stunning property was built in 2023 and is presented in excellent condition throughout. Extending to approx. 124sqm/ 1,335 sq.ft., this turn key property has been decorated with stylish modern features, including wall panelling in the sitting room, open plan kitchen/ dining with intergrated appliances and all bathrooms have beautiful tiles floor to ceiling.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from a paved area to the front for parking and a private rear garden.\n\nThis residence has been finished to a high stand and would make an ideal family home, close to amenities in Navan.\n\nLOCATION\nRowleys Lock is a modern residential development conveniently located along the Boyne Road which is within easy reach of Navan Town Centre, with schools, shops, sporting facilities and a wide range of local amenities nearby. The M3 motorway is also readily accessible, providing convenient access towards Dublin.\n\nViewing highly recommended\n\nGROUND FLOOR\n\nEntrance Hall: 2.11m x 6.80m\nSpacious entrance hall with staircase to first floor and storage.\n\nSitting Room: 3.79m x 4.56m\nGenerously proportioned reception room located to the front of the property, with hard wood flooring and wall paneling\n\nKitchen: 3.79m x 3.97m\nContemporary fitted kitchen with excellent storage, integrated appliances and large central island.\n\nDining Area: 2.21m x 3.44m\nBright dining area adjoining the kitchen with access to the rear garden.\n\nUtility: 2.10m x 1.61m\nSpacious utility with storage space\n\nGuest WC: 1.58m x 1.61m\nStylish guest bathroom tiled floor to ceiling\n\nFIRST FLOOR\n\nLanding: 1.03m x 3.90m\n\nBedroom 1: 3.53m x 5.32m\nSpacious double bedroom with built in wardrobes\n\nEnsuite: 2.52m x 1.61m\nTiled floor to ceiling\n\nBedroom 2: 3.53m x 3.97m\nDouble bedroom overlooking the rear garden\n\nBedroom 3: 2.76m x 3.44m\n\nSpacious bedroom or home office\n\nFamily Bathroom: 2.38m x 3.36m\nModern and stylish family bathroom\n\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
